orged from priceless ithilmar, an\n Weapon                     Range          Str    AP   D\n                                                              extremely light but strong metal, found only in the\n Gromril Great Axe          Melee 3        S+2    -3   2\n                                                              fabled Elven kingdoms. A few of these weapons are\n                                                              occasionally found in the Old World and these are\nTraits: Hack, Pulverise, Strike Last, Two Handed              normally spoils of war, taken by the Norse raiders who\n                                                              pillage the coastal settlements of the Elves.\n\n                      Halberd                                  Weapon                Range           Str    AP      D\nThe halberd’s heavy blade is mounted upon a sturdy             Ithilmar Sword        Melee 2          S      -      1\nshaft of oak or steel and has a point like a spear and a\ncutting edge like an axe. Since it can be used to chop as     Traits: Parry, Strike First\nwell as thrust, it is an adaptable weapon, and can be\nused to keep opponents at bay.\n                                                                               Morning star\n Weapon              Range         Str           AP    D\n                                                              A morning star consists of a wooden or steel shaft with\n Halberd             Melee 4       S+1           -1    1\n                                                              a heavy chain that has a large, spiked steel ball attached.\n                                                              It is a one-handed weapon, but very destructive and\nTraits: Hack, Knock back, Two Handed                          requires great skill to wield effectively.\n\n                                                               Weapon              Range             Str    AP      D\n            