 AP D\n                                                              Warplock Musket               36       5       -2     2\n Weapon              Range        Str         AP    D\n Handgun              24           4          -1    1       Traits: Blackpowder, Knockback, Penetrating, Pick\n                                                            Target, Reload (2).\nTraits: Blackpowder, Penetrating, Reload (2)\n\n                                                                           Warplock pistol\n           Hochland long rifle                              Warplock pistols are terrifying weapons, testimony to\nHochland is a province famed for its hunters, and the       the mad genius of Clan Skryre engineers. Warplock\npreferred weapon of its nobility when they go hunting       pistols shoot ammunition made of magically treated\nis a long-ranged rifle. They are extremely rare and         warpstone and wounds caused by warplock pistols are\nprecious weapons, and only the most experienced             horrible to behold and often cause infections.\ngunsmiths are capable of manufacturing them.\n                                                             Weapon                      Range     Str    AP     D\n Weapon                      Range      Str    AP      D     Warplock Pistol               8        5     -2     1\n Hochland Long Rifle          48         5     -2      2\n                                                            Traits: Blackpowder, Pistol, Penetrating, Reload (2)\nTraits:    Accuracy,      Blackpowder,        Knockback,    Rending.\nPenetrating, Pick Target, Reload (2)..\n\n\n                      Pistol\nA pistol is a small, simple blackpowder weapon fired by\na match-lock mechanism. Most pistols are expensive,\nunreliable, and poorly constructed.\n\n Weapon              Range        Str         AP    D\n Pistol                6           4          -1    1\n\nTraits: Blackpowder, Penetrating, Pistol, Reload (2)\n\n\n\nMORDHEIM\n\n[