e the hallmarks of a     COST TO HIRE: 80 Gold Crowns.\nsuccessful Mercenary Captain, it is no wonder that they flock      In any Mercenary warband there is one warrior who is bigger,\nto Mordheim.                                                       stronger (and often uglier) than his comrades. These men are\n M    WS    BS    S   T    W    I   A   LD    CL    WIL     INT    called Chosen Men (or berserkers, first swordsmen and\n 4     4     4    4   3    2    4   3    8     8      7      7\n                                                                   various other names). Chosen men are amongst the toughest\n                                                                   and the best warriors in the warband. They often answer\nWEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT:                                             challenges issued to the warband and, after the Captain, they\nA Mercenary Captain starts with no equipment. They may             get the pick of any equipment and loot.\n                                                                    M    WS    BS   S   T   W    I   A    LD   CL    WIL    INT\npurchase Close Combat Weapons, Special Weapons, Armour,\nand Wargear from the Middenheimer Equipment List.                   4     4     3   4   3    2   4   2    8     7     7      7\n\n\nSPECIAL RULES:                                                     WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT:\nRace (Human), Leader                                               A Chosen Man starts with no equipment. They may purchase\n                                                                   Close Combat Weapons, Special Weapons, Armour, and\nSTARTING SKILL:                                                    Wargear from the Middenheimer Equipment List.\nWhen recruited, a Leader may choose one skill from their\nPrimary skill sets. This skill does not cost any XP and does       SPECIAL RULES:\nnot increase the warrior’s credit value.                           Race (Human), Champion\n\n           